      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The Authors valued effects of the extinction-test with Thiapride (200 mg i.v.) in the primary headaches. They particularly noticed a significant reduction of PGF2-alpha and PRL, together with an increase of 5-HT and beta-ELI in CSF."},
